      "review_description": "I'm old now and have met many people during my time. It's hard to find trustworthy people like Julian nowadays. He is the type of person I would leave the house keys with and have no worries. He guided us during the whole process and handled everything. Hardly lifted a finger myself. His team also helped us remove our old solar system, and the birds nests and leaves that were under it. Took photos with his drone for us after the installation was completed. Explained the next steps and how the solar app works. Fantastic installation and I would recommend Jenergy any day of the week. We also had an issue with our garage power(unrelated to solar) later on and Julian came out to fix it that very day. Thanks again mate, best of luck.",
